# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# SpeakWise frontend env (copy to .env.local)
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
#
# The frontend now needs only the Supabase public keys. The Gemini API key
# lives as a Supabase Edge Function secret — see supabase/README.md for how
# to set it with `supabase secrets set GEMINI_API_KEY=...`.

VITE_SUPABASE_URL=https://your-project-id.supabase.co
VITE_SUPABASE_ANON_KEY=your-anon-key-here
